  "title": "Third Quarter 2025 Financial and Operational Results",
  "summary": "DENVER–(BUSINESS WIRE)– Liberty Energy Inc. (NYSE: LBRT; “Liberty” or the “Company”) today reported third quarter 2025 financial and operational results. Summary Results and Highlights Revenue of $947 million, a 9% sequential decrease Net income of $43 million, or $0.26 fully diluted earnings per share (“EPS”) Adjusted EBITDA1 of $128 million Distributed $13 million to shareholders through cash dividends Increased quarterly cash dividend by…",
